<title>FRANCE: Alcatel - Thomson decision on right lines.</title>
<headline>Alcatel - Thomson decision on right lines.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said on Wednesday it welcomed the government's decision to sell Thomson-CSF through a private placement which it said was a step in the right direction.</p>
<p>Alcatel has lined up state-owned aircraft and defence firm Aerospatiale and Dassault Aviation for a joint bid for Thomson-CSF.</p>
<p>&quot;It goes in the right direction,&quot; an Alcatel spokesman told Reuters after the government's announcement. &quot;We are awaiting the publication of the terms and conditions,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>The government, which announced earlier on Wednesday it would sell Thomson-CSF through a private placement, said it would submit shortly terms and conditions to the Privatisation Commission.</p>
